- 2026-11-21 16:1x PST, thread 1572407822849810463 (Osama: "add variants of all the units we have multiple textures for as a paint option", "for our Chinese
  and new models, remove the default skins", "Armory quality", "do it for all the models we have packs now", "add it in this one"). ASSETS + FAModels 0.3.36:
  PaintSchemes.cs. Pack colour sets (plain / desert / desert camo / mix / yellow / green / digital) for 31 units (PLZ-05, PLZ-45A4/70/83/85/89, PCL-09,
  PLL-09, PGZ-88, PGZ-09, PGL-625, PTL-02, ZTL-11, ZTL-191 (+Recon), ZTZ-96/96A, ZBL-09/08, Z-21 (+Recon), DF-21/21D, DF-31A, AFT-10/HJ-10, HQ-17/17A,
  HQ-7/7B, LY-1) as <texture>@<Scheme>.fat at the default texture's exact size/mips (BC7), + paint-schemes.json + paint/ button swatches.
